    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21859" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γενει-άω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γενειάζω</span>
			, <i>grow a beard, get a beard</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὴν δὴ παῖδα γενειήσαντα ἴδηαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					18.269
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				176
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Nat.Puer.</u>
				20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				2.6.28
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς ἄνδρα γενειῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					14.28
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
